# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Working / archive folder (originals before being copied to project root)
Website Build/
Website Photo/
New Whiteboard/

# Local backups / exports — never commit
SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.zip
images/builder.zip

# Audit artifacts
responsive-audit/
audit/captures/
audit/.auth-state.json

# Temp files
*.tmp
*.log

# Memory / Claude project files (don't commit private notes)
memory/
.claude/

# Backend runtime data — never commit. Contains the hashed admin password
# (auth.json) and all real customer leads (leads.json). Wildcard-form so
# the negation below can re-include the static project-rates.json catalog
# (gitignore won't re-include from an ignored directory).
server/data/*
server/data/*/
# Exception: project-rates.json is a STATIC catalog (admin-only project-scale
# rates for the proposal builder), NOT runtime-mutable data. Ships with the
# code so the deployed server has the catalog. Mirror of how pricing.json /
# parts.json live at the repo root. Brief 1 (May 2026).
!server/data/project-rates.json
# Migration safety backups (created by scripts/migrate-customers.js --apply).
# These snapshot server/data/ before a customer migration runs; they live
# only on disk and never get committed.
server/data-backup-*/

# Backend secrets — never commit. Holds Gmail and Twilio credentials.
.env

# Node packages (we have none right now, but in case we add any later)
node_modules/

# Wrangler local cache (contains OAuth tokens)
worker/.wrangler/

# Design / smoke-test PDF outputs — regenerated on demand
_design/_smoke/
